you could tell they were oh no you can
tell what's going on sure having worked

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:20.790
on other television shows you knew you
didn't want to quote demoralize of the

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:25.169
other writers I wanted to make them feel
a part of the process true so what were

